<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Antec said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Antec said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp raised ANTEC Corp to outperform from market performer, a market source said</p>
<p>-- Analyst unavailable for comment</p>
<p>-- ANTEC, which said Wednesday it was discussing a merger with TSX Corp, was up 1/8 to 16-3/4 in morning trade</p>
</text>
